WEBVTT

01:40.520 --> 01:41.880
Jiang Li,

01:42.480 --> 01:44.120
please don't blame me.

01:44.720 --> 01:46.360
Your aunt is in their hands.

01:46.440 --> 01:47.680
I…

01:47.760 --> 01:49.440
I had no choice but to do this.

01:51.160 --> 01:52.000
Don't blame me.

01:53.200 --> 01:59.760
YONG'AN PAVILION

02:00.720 --> 02:02.200
Did she drive you mad?

02:04.720 --> 02:06.360
I did not touch her.

02:07.120 --> 02:09.080
She is the bait to lure Xiao Heng.

02:09.680 --> 02:11.440
We cannot afford any mishaps now.

02:12.040 --> 02:14.560
I understand.
But with the imminent battle,

02:15.560 --> 02:17.480
you even have to deal with Xiao Heng.

02:18.120 --> 02:19.440
Is he such a big threat?

02:20.040 --> 02:21.840
He can endure what others cannot.

02:23.000 --> 02:24.640
It naturally makes me wary.

02:25.480 --> 02:28.120
Whether he knows that Xiao Minghan
died because of me or not,

02:29.120 --> 02:30.640
we must eliminate the threat early

02:31.560 --> 02:35.280
to avoid any mishaps
when my grand plan is about to succeed.

02:36.160 --> 02:38.720
Rest assured. If Xiao Heng comes,

02:38.800 --> 02:40.600
I'll ensure he doesn't leave
my mansion alive.

02:41.160 --> 02:42.080
That's good.

02:42.920 --> 02:44.880
I'll go back and prepare
for tonight first.

02:45.360 --> 02:47.080
Do not let me down again.

02:49.360 --> 02:54.480
YONG'AN PAVILION

02:58.440 --> 03:00.200
All the secret guards are in disguise.

03:00.280 --> 03:02.720
Except for a few left
at the Duke's Mansion and Jiang Residence,

03:02.800 --> 03:04.880
the rest are positioned
at critical locations.

03:04.960 --> 03:07.680
Good, make sure to guard
these three defense lines well.

03:07.760 --> 03:09.360
No one should be allowed in.

03:09.440 --> 03:10.760
Even if imperial guards arrive,

03:11.240 --> 03:12.720
do not let them in.

03:13.960 --> 03:15.960
We are the last line of defense
for His Majesty.

03:16.600 --> 03:17.560
Yes.

03:19.440 --> 03:20.280
My lord!

03:21.960 --> 03:22.880
I deserve to die.

03:23.440 --> 03:25.200
- Her ladyship is captured.
- What happened?

03:25.280 --> 03:26.560
I just finished interrogation.

03:26.640 --> 03:28.240
Eldest Princess threatened Jiang Yuanxing

03:28.320 --> 03:29.160
to lure her ladyship out.

03:29.240 --> 03:30.840
The secret guards following her
were also stopped.

03:30.920 --> 03:32.360
We don't know
her ladyship's whereabouts now.

03:32.440 --> 03:33.840
But she must be in the hands
of the Eldest Princess.

03:33.920 --> 03:35.280
I'll mobilize a team of secret guards.

03:36.840 --> 03:38.240
It's a diversion. We can't fall for it.

03:38.840 --> 03:41.400
- I'll go alone.
- No, it's clearly a trap.

03:41.480 --> 03:42.440
If you fall into it,

03:42.520 --> 03:43.880
who will command tonight's operation?

03:43.960 --> 03:45.040
Rest assured.

03:45.120 --> 03:47.120
I wouldn't miss
such a splendid palace banquet.

03:47.200 --> 03:48.920
You only need to act according to plan

03:49.000 --> 03:50.240
and ensure His Majesty's safety.

03:51.760 --> 03:55.600
With the imminent battle,
how can the commander leave his post?

04:02.920 --> 04:04.360
I'll save my granddaughter-in-law.

04:05.760 --> 04:09.280
What? Am I not as good as my grandson?

04:12.760 --> 04:13.800
Be careful.

04:29.160 --> 04:30.000
Your Highness,

04:30.080 --> 04:31.040
this is a special soup

04:31.120 --> 04:32.560
Mr. Shen requested from the kitchen.

04:32.640 --> 04:34.960
He said Your Highness
has lost weight recently

04:35.040 --> 04:36.360
and should take better care of yourself.

04:36.440 --> 04:38.200
He finally gets it.

04:39.280 --> 04:40.640
Why didn't he come personally?

04:40.720 --> 04:42.720
Mr. Shen said he will come shortly.

04:48.840 --> 04:49.720
YONG'AN PAVILION

04:49.800 --> 04:52.760
The Eldest Princess sent me to get her.
Open the door.

04:52.840 --> 04:53.680
Yes.

04:58.200 --> 04:59.040
You may go.

05:07.760 --> 05:08.800
What are you doing here?

05:08.880 --> 05:11.120
You previously asked
if I wanted to kill you a second time.

05:12.400 --> 05:13.840
Now, I'll tell you the answer.

05:13.920 --> 05:15.280
Do you want to save me?

05:15.360 --> 05:18.440
Yes, I'm here to take you away.

05:18.520 --> 05:20.000
Wanning is truly pitiful.

05:22.040 --> 05:23.320
She mistakenly fell for you.

05:23.400 --> 05:24.560
She was the one who harmed me.

05:28.480 --> 05:29.840
How did she harm you?

05:29.920 --> 05:33.280
Everything was your choice.

05:34.280 --> 05:37.080
You fear losing your life, your career,

05:39.040 --> 05:41.160
your mother, and your sister.

05:42.160 --> 05:44.520
I can understand. If you told me,

05:44.600 --> 05:46.520
I wouldn't insist on staying by your side.

05:46.600 --> 05:48.280
But I don't understand

05:48.800 --> 05:50.840
why you would kill me with your own hands.

05:51.320 --> 05:53.920
I was forced. Wanning forced me!

05:59.720 --> 06:00.560
Xue Li.

06:02.240 --> 06:03.440
Xue Li, don't act this way.

06:06.400 --> 06:07.440
I'll go with you.

06:08.520 --> 06:09.360
Really?

06:10.360 --> 06:11.600
Take me to your home.

06:12.640 --> 06:14.080
I haven't been there in a long time.

06:14.160 --> 06:15.320
I'd like to see it again.

06:17.520 --> 06:18.360
All right.

06:36.960 --> 06:39.320
Sleep, Xue Li.

06:45.000 --> 06:46.320
It'll be fine after you wake up.

06:53.160 --> 06:54.400
Your Highness, what's wrong?

06:54.480 --> 06:56.160
I'll get the imperial
physician immediately.

07:03.480 --> 07:04.680
Why isn't Shen Yurong here yet?

07:04.760 --> 07:06.440
I'll send someone to find him right away.

07:09.000 --> 07:11.320
Go and get me the antidote mint pills.

07:11.400 --> 07:13.440
But the mint pills might not work.

07:13.520 --> 07:14.920
I want to find him myself.

07:16.680 --> 07:17.720
Hurry up and go.

07:29.800 --> 07:31.000
YONG'AN PAVILION

07:43.440 --> 07:44.280
Where are you going?

07:48.320 --> 07:51.600
Are you going to kill me to save her?

07:58.320 --> 08:02.760
YONG'AN PAVILION

08:20.240 --> 08:24.000
I already drank the soup you sent.

08:26.160 --> 08:27.760
I want a truthful answer from you.

08:28.800 --> 08:30.280
What do you want to hear?

08:31.440 --> 08:33.960
I once forced you to kill her.

08:35.440 --> 08:38.720
I didn't expect that in the end,
you'd still choose her.

08:40.360 --> 08:41.559
Haven't I treated you well?

08:42.720 --> 08:44.360
How could you bear to poison me?

08:45.600 --> 08:47.240
My brother won't spare you.

08:47.320 --> 08:48.160
Why wouldn't I dare?

08:49.320 --> 08:53.040
Prince Cheng needs a reason
to launch his attack.

08:53.640 --> 08:57.520
His Majesty killed his sister,
so he rose in anger.

08:58.560 --> 09:01.760
On the day he rises in rebellion,
the whole nation will mourn in white.

09:01.840 --> 09:05.880
I've even thought
of how the history books will record it.

09:07.080 --> 09:08.360
He probably

09:08.880 --> 09:10.960
has your eulogy ready too.

09:14.400 --> 09:15.680
This is your fate.

09:16.520 --> 09:17.360
All your life,

09:18.000 --> 09:20.360
you can only be a pawn used by people,

09:22.560 --> 09:23.680
discarded ruthlessly

09:24.320 --> 09:26.600
when no longer needed.

09:32.560 --> 09:33.400
Shen Yurong,

09:37.920 --> 09:38.960
have you ever loved me?

10:08.360 --> 10:10.040
You gave me this hairpin.

10:14.040 --> 10:15.480
I will return it to you now.

10:54.360 --> 10:57.520
Don't you just want to use me as a reason
to start a rebellion?

10:58.160 --> 10:59.320
I will give it to you.

11:00.560 --> 11:04.120
But if the people don't believe

11:04.200 --> 11:06.320
my brother killed me,

11:07.920 --> 11:09.880
do you think Prince Cheng
will protect you?

11:11.280 --> 11:13.400
Then you'll be the sinner who killed me.

11:26.240 --> 11:27.560
You wanted to kill me,

11:28.640 --> 11:30.600
so I'll wait for you in hell.

12:51.080 --> 12:52.280
Don't look at me like that.

12:53.760 --> 12:55.400
I've already avenged you.

12:55.480 --> 12:57.360
You were the one who killed me.

13:01.040 --> 13:03.560
If you want to avenge me,

13:06.120 --> 13:07.280
then

13:08.280 --> 13:09.360
kill yourself.

13:13.920 --> 13:14.760
I can't die.

13:17.040 --> 13:18.120
If I die,

13:20.160 --> 13:21.160
who will protect you?

13:22.000 --> 13:24.160
I don't need your protection!

13:27.920 --> 13:29.480
You're still thinking about Xiao Heng.

13:30.160 --> 13:31.040
Listen.

13:34.400 --> 13:35.360
He will die too.

13:37.520 --> 13:38.840
What did you say?

13:39.920 --> 13:40.880
Look at this.

13:40.960 --> 13:42.160
COMMANDER OF THE LONGWU ARMY,
GENERAL YANG QING

13:42.240 --> 13:43.400
What is this?

13:44.160 --> 13:46.440
With this plan,
you'll be credited the highest merit.

13:46.520 --> 13:48.400
Tell me, what do you want?

13:48.480 --> 13:50.640
When your troops enter the city,

13:51.400 --> 13:53.160
please hand me the fish talisman.

13:54.040 --> 13:55.000
I want to kill

13:56.040 --> 13:57.240
Xiao Heng myself.

13:57.800 --> 13:58.760
So you hate him too.

13:58.840 --> 14:00.320
To the bones.

14:01.760 --> 14:02.680
You scumbag!

14:03.920 --> 14:04.960
Go ahead and curse me.

14:07.920 --> 14:09.240
You have every right to do so.

14:09.320 --> 14:10.520
But after today,

14:11.800 --> 14:12.960
please don't scold me anymore.

14:15.400 --> 14:17.400
I will clean myself thoroughly.

14:18.560 --> 14:19.640
Please don't despise me.

14:20.400 --> 14:22.040
I will return everything to you.

14:24.680 --> 14:25.520
Get some sleep.

15:05.520 --> 15:08.800
Your Majesty, Prince Cheng, Consort Li,

15:08.880 --> 15:09.720
and officials.

15:09.800 --> 15:11.880
The Music Affairs Division composed
a new marching tune

15:11.960 --> 15:13.720
to welcome Prince Cheng's return.

15:13.800 --> 15:15.800
Your Majesty, Prince Cheng,
please listen to it.

15:18.960 --> 15:21.440
HEAVEN'S AUSPICIOUS RESPONSE
TO MONARCH'S HIGH VIRTUE

15:21.520 --> 15:25.000
I didn't expect Your Majesty
to compose a new piece for me.

15:25.080 --> 15:28.200
You've dedicated yourself to Great Yan
for so many years.

15:28.280 --> 15:31.440
Your loyalty and bravery are exemplary
in the Imperial Court.

15:32.000 --> 15:35.200
I often tell the officials to emulate you,

15:35.280 --> 15:36.720
not only for your achievements,

15:36.800 --> 15:38.720
but also for your loyalty
to the Imperial Court

15:38.800 --> 15:39.920
and the people.

15:41.040 --> 15:43.080
Only then can the people benefit.

15:43.640 --> 15:45.040
Your Majesty is too kind.

15:47.040 --> 15:48.800
A loyal heart is devoted to a wise ruler.

15:48.880 --> 15:51.880
As long as Your Majesty
remains benevolent,

15:52.360 --> 15:53.360
blessing the people,

15:54.040 --> 15:57.640
we will serve Your Majesty wholeheartedly.

15:59.400 --> 16:00.720
Let's encourage each other.

16:00.800 --> 16:03.200
May my benevolent heart last

16:03.280 --> 16:06.120
and may you remain loyal and righteous.

16:13.440 --> 16:17.760
HENING GATE

16:18.600 --> 16:23.960
TAIJI HALL

16:45.280 --> 16:46.560
IMPERIAL GUARDS OFFICE

16:46.640 --> 16:49.200
Tonight, stay with me
to guard outside the hall.

16:49.280 --> 16:50.560
Don't let your guard down.

16:50.640 --> 16:51.480
- Yes!
- Yes!

16:57.360 --> 16:58.600
Xu Zhi?

17:00.160 --> 17:03.080
Commander of the imperial guards,
Zhang Wei,

17:03.160 --> 17:06.240
has been secretly
trafficking weapons to the north

17:06.319 --> 17:09.000
and plotting rebellion. Arrest him!

17:17.880 --> 17:19.720
I planned to keep you alive
for a few more days.

17:19.800 --> 17:22.400
I didn't expect you to be so eager to die.

17:22.880 --> 17:23.720
Take him.

17:24.680 --> 17:25.520
You…

17:27.560 --> 17:28.400
Xu Zhi,

17:30.480 --> 17:33.680
I have long known
you're General Xiao's spy.

17:34.240 --> 17:35.880
The reason I didn't get rid of you earlier

17:35.960 --> 17:37.760
is to make you believe

17:37.840 --> 17:39.360
your plan was succeeding.

17:39.440 --> 17:40.280
Zhang Wei,

17:41.000 --> 17:43.720
do you realize this is treason?

17:49.560 --> 17:51.120
You are just being short-sighted!

17:51.200 --> 17:53.120
Once Prince Cheng ascends the throne,

17:53.200 --> 17:54.080
I…

17:54.640 --> 17:57.000
will be given merit
for establishing his reign!

17:57.080 --> 17:57.920
Take him away.

17:58.000 --> 18:00.720
- You… Zhang Wei…
- Move it.

18:02.760 --> 18:04.040
Everyone, listen up!

18:04.120 --> 18:05.560
When Prince Cheng gives the signal,

18:06.280 --> 18:07.280
attack immediately.

18:08.000 --> 18:09.360
All of you better stay alert!

18:09.920 --> 18:10.760
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

18:11.280 --> 18:13.000
LI RESIDENCE

18:23.040 --> 18:25.400
This looks quite real.

18:25.480 --> 18:26.760
She's really dead.

18:29.040 --> 18:30.160
Are you crazy?

18:30.720 --> 18:32.440
The Eldest Princess realized
she was drugged

18:32.920 --> 18:34.160
and misunderstood my intentions,

18:35.120 --> 18:37.600
then killed herself in despair.

18:37.680 --> 18:40.000
I couldn't stop her or explain in time.

18:40.080 --> 18:41.720
Then what am I supposed to do now?

18:43.720 --> 18:45.160
Proceed with the original plan.

18:45.760 --> 18:47.760
We can't jeopardize
Prince Cheng's great undertaking.

18:48.320 --> 18:52.240
After it is done,
I will personally confess to him.

18:56.240 --> 18:57.080
Let's go

18:57.160 --> 18:58.400
to the palace.

19:10.000 --> 19:11.720
Your Highness!

19:13.080 --> 19:14.840
Your Highness!

19:16.520 --> 19:18.720
Your Highness!

19:24.040 --> 19:25.320
Do you have anything to say?

19:26.840 --> 19:28.440
There's no turning back for you now.

19:29.600 --> 19:30.840
Then wait for me to return.

19:31.880 --> 19:33.080
Guard her well.

19:33.160 --> 19:34.040
Yes.

19:41.040 --> 19:42.040
Who dares to hurt her?

19:43.920 --> 19:45.120
General Xiao.

19:45.720 --> 19:46.840
Go and rescue Xiao Heng!

19:47.600 --> 19:49.200
Shen Yurong took the fish talisman.

19:49.280 --> 19:52.160
Tonight, the one the Longwu Army
will kill is Xiao Heng.

19:54.520 --> 19:56.360
I still have to save you first.

19:56.440 --> 19:58.640
Step back! Unless you want
to get splattered with blood!

19:58.720 --> 19:59.760
General Xiao.

20:02.880 --> 20:03.760
Mister.

20:10.080 --> 20:10.920
We meet again.

20:11.640 --> 20:12.480
Lai Biao?

20:16.240 --> 20:17.480
Mr. Biao, he's here.

20:20.040 --> 20:21.040
Why are you here alone?

20:21.600 --> 20:22.960
Where is Xiao Heng?

20:23.040 --> 20:24.440
Duke Su went to Great Zhao

20:25.280 --> 20:26.480
and left a message for you.

20:26.560 --> 20:27.680
What is it?

20:27.760 --> 20:30.600
Duke Su said it is time.

20:36.560 --> 20:37.680
You're just in time.

20:37.760 --> 20:39.680
General, you should admit
you're getting old.

20:40.360 --> 20:42.040
Leave the rest to us.

20:42.520 --> 20:43.360
Take her with you.

20:43.440 --> 20:46.720
All right.
I'll leave it to you young people.

20:46.800 --> 20:47.720
All right.

20:48.280 --> 20:49.120
Attack!

20:49.200 --> 20:50.040
Attack!

20:59.680 --> 21:00.800
They've already made a move.

21:00.880 --> 21:01.960
Bring His Majesty out now.

21:02.040 --> 21:03.160
I'll meet you at the back.

21:14.720 --> 21:15.680
Your Majesty.

21:24.000 --> 21:26.800
I've had a bit too much to drink
and need to go to the restroom.

21:31.960 --> 21:33.800
Your Majesty, where are you going?

21:33.880 --> 21:35.320
Don't tell me you won't come back.

21:35.880 --> 21:38.120
The performance is reaching its climax.

21:38.200 --> 21:39.520
Why wouldn't I come back?

21:39.600 --> 21:44.560
How about I go with you
after the song finishes?

22:08.760 --> 22:11.600
Prince Cheng, I'm still here.

22:11.680 --> 22:13.160
How could His Majesty not come back?

22:27.280 --> 22:29.040
Come on, Prince Cheng.

22:30.000 --> 22:31.680
Let me toast to you.

22:45.440 --> 22:46.280
Your Majesty.

22:48.360 --> 22:49.360
Your Majesty.

23:27.400 --> 23:28.800
They'll meet you at the west gate.

23:28.880 --> 23:29.760
Lu Ji will escort you.

23:29.840 --> 23:30.920
You're not coming with me?

23:31.000 --> 23:33.160
Prince Cheng is still inside.
I'll cover the rear.

23:33.720 --> 23:36.360
Tomorrow, I want to see you alive.

23:38.080 --> 23:39.080
Yes, Your Majesty.

23:48.080 --> 23:49.000
Your Highness!

23:51.240 --> 23:52.080
Your Highness!

23:53.400 --> 23:54.640
Your Highness!

23:54.720 --> 23:55.720
Your Highness!

23:57.120 --> 23:58.320
The Eldest Princess is killed.

23:58.400 --> 24:00.000
- The Eldest Princess?
- What?

24:00.080 --> 24:01.120
Who did this?

24:01.200 --> 24:02.880
- Why would anyone kill her?
- That's right.

24:02.960 --> 24:03.800
What is going on?

24:03.880 --> 24:05.960
Emperor Zhao Ye killed her.

24:06.040 --> 24:08.520
The emperor killed the Eldest Princess!

24:09.360 --> 24:10.880
Why would His Majesty
kill the Eldest Princess?

24:10.960 --> 24:13.080
- That's right.
- How could His Majesty be behind this?

24:13.640 --> 24:15.720
The emperor said
your merits overshadow his,

24:15.800 --> 24:18.640
and he can't let you
leave the capital alive,

24:19.520 --> 24:21.040
so he had his secret guards capture

24:21.120 --> 24:23.040
the Eldest Princess as a hostage.

24:23.520 --> 24:25.360
The Eldest Princess died from resisting.

24:25.440 --> 24:27.320
I fought desperately

24:27.400 --> 24:32.360
to bring her here to seek justice.

24:34.600 --> 24:36.280
No!

24:39.040 --> 24:39.960
Wanning…

24:41.440 --> 24:44.840
Emperor Zhao Ye harmed his own kin,

24:44.920 --> 24:46.560
disregarding benevolence
and righteousness,

24:47.120 --> 24:49.320
violating the heavens' law.

24:49.880 --> 24:55.000
I ask everyone here to be my witness.

24:55.080 --> 24:57.280
It is Zhao Ye who cannot tolerate me.

24:58.320 --> 25:01.960
For years, I have led the soldiers
in bloody battles,

25:03.360 --> 25:06.640
not asking for any reward,
only to protect the land.

25:07.840 --> 25:10.760
But in return, I get Zhao Ye's suspicion,

25:11.320 --> 25:12.280
siege, and annihilation.

25:12.800 --> 25:13.800
Today,

25:15.800 --> 25:18.840
he brutally killed my twin sister!

25:19.480 --> 25:20.840
Nonsense!

25:21.440 --> 25:23.600
How can you turn
the Eldest Princess' accidental death

25:24.200 --> 25:26.200
into a murder committed by His Majesty?

25:26.280 --> 25:28.840
The Court of Judicial Review Minister
should come and investigate.

25:28.920 --> 25:29.960
- Yes.
- Right.

25:30.040 --> 25:32.960
Yes, we should find out the truth
before making any conclusions.

25:33.040 --> 25:34.120
You knew long ago

25:34.200 --> 25:36.760
that Zhao Ye wanted
to kill the Eldest Princess, didn't you?

25:36.840 --> 25:38.760
You are an accomplice.

25:38.840 --> 25:39.960
Guards!

25:44.840 --> 25:47.040
Seize this vile person.

25:47.120 --> 25:49.840
Zhao Sheng, are you rebelling?

25:49.920 --> 25:51.000
- Let go of me!
- Right.

25:51.480 --> 25:52.640
- Let go!
- Yes.

25:54.720 --> 25:55.960
Rebel?

25:59.720 --> 26:00.560
Today,

26:02.960 --> 26:04.920
I will act on behalf of the heavens
to seek justice

26:05.480 --> 26:09.280
for the Eldest Princess
and the fallen soldiers

26:10.000 --> 26:12.120
and make Zhao Ye pay!

26:12.200 --> 26:14.680
If anyone has any objections, speak now.

26:15.240 --> 26:18.760
If you remain silent now
but dissent later,

26:19.720 --> 26:22.800
I will have you executed without mercy!

26:24.240 --> 26:26.080
Seeking justice on behalf of the heavens?

26:26.160 --> 26:27.560
You are coveting power

26:27.640 --> 26:28.840
and plotting rebellion now.

26:38.840 --> 26:41.400
I pledge to follow Your Highness

26:41.480 --> 26:43.200
and avenge the Eldest Princess.

26:49.200 --> 26:52.120
- I pledge to follow Your Highness
- I pledge to follow Your Highness

26:52.200 --> 26:54.160
- and avenge the Eldest Princess!
- and avenge the Eldest Princess!

26:54.240 --> 26:59.680
Soldiers, heed my command!
Destroy Zhao Ye with all your might!

26:59.760 --> 27:00.720
- Yes!
- Yes!

27:16.280 --> 27:19.000
Everyone, listen up!
The Emperor is cruel and unrighteous

27:19.080 --> 27:20.360
and killed the Eldest Princess.

27:20.440 --> 27:23.520
Follow me to the palace
to overthrow him immediately!

27:33.280 --> 27:35.680
Commander, someone just sent a signal.

27:49.800 --> 27:51.680
Zhang Wei has rebelled. Seize him!

27:52.240 --> 27:53.560
Attack!

28:12.360 --> 28:13.200
Zhao Sheng,

28:14.560 --> 28:15.600
we meet again.

28:16.120 --> 28:16.960
Kid,

28:18.120 --> 28:20.920
your weapon is quite delicate.

28:21.000 --> 28:22.440
It suffices.

28:28.040 --> 28:29.560
How vicious.

28:29.640 --> 28:31.840
After all, my father had a taste

28:31.920 --> 28:33.600
of your viciousness firsthand.

28:39.600 --> 28:40.520
I don't dare…

28:44.600 --> 28:46.080
to be careless.

28:46.640 --> 28:48.600
This is the sword your father once used.

28:49.720 --> 28:50.840
It is a fine sword.

28:51.400 --> 28:54.840
He and I once fought together
against our enemies.

28:54.920 --> 28:57.280
He taught me martial arts with this sword

28:58.560 --> 29:01.520
and saved me on the battlefield with it.

29:02.080 --> 29:04.960
Speaking of him, I miss him dearly.

29:05.040 --> 29:06.600
If you truly miss him,

29:07.320 --> 29:09.440
why don't you tell me

29:09.520 --> 29:11.360
how you harmed my father eight years ago?

29:12.200 --> 29:15.240
My father never guarded against you
and trusted you completely.

29:15.760 --> 29:17.800
Yet you plotted against him
and betrayed him.

29:17.880 --> 29:19.800
I saw him as a brother

29:21.040 --> 29:22.560
and respected him as my master.

29:23.480 --> 29:25.560
If he did not stand in my way back then,

29:25.640 --> 29:27.800
I would be sitting on the throne

29:27.880 --> 29:29.200
in the palace now!

29:29.280 --> 29:31.160
After I capture you,

29:31.240 --> 29:33.360
I will slaughter
your 100,000 rebel soldiers

29:33.440 --> 29:35.040
to avenge my father!

29:35.120 --> 29:36.960
The fate of Xiao Minghan in the past

29:39.080 --> 29:40.760
will be yours today.

29:41.480 --> 29:42.680
Those who block me

29:43.760 --> 29:44.640
will be killed!

29:44.720 --> 29:48.040
- Attack!
- Attack!

31:20.080 --> 31:21.840
CAPITAL OF YAN

31:25.400 --> 31:29.280
CAPITAL OF YAN

31:33.480 --> 31:34.360
Who let him in?

31:34.440 --> 31:36.640
CAPITAL OF YAN

31:36.720 --> 31:40.320
General Yang Qing, commander
of the Longwu Army, hear my command.

31:46.080 --> 31:47.760
Open the city gates

31:48.280 --> 31:50.200
and let the northern army in.

31:51.280 --> 31:52.120
What did you say?

31:52.200 --> 31:53.680
Are you going to defy military orders?

31:55.280 --> 31:58.520
The fish talisman is here.
Those who defy orders

31:58.600 --> 31:59.800
will be executed!

32:05.840 --> 32:08.800
Soldiers, listen up! Open the gates!

32:09.480 --> 32:12.120
Let the northern army enter the capital!

32:25.760 --> 32:26.760
Your Majesty,

32:26.840 --> 32:28.720
just past the path ahead
is the west palace gate.

33:15.400 --> 33:16.880
General Xiao treated you well.

33:17.440 --> 33:18.840
Why are you being a traitor?

33:18.920 --> 33:20.240
Wise men submit to circumstances.

33:22.320 --> 33:23.600
Following Prince Cheng is…

33:34.000 --> 33:37.120
Zhang Wei is dead.
Rebels, surrender immediately!

34:00.880 --> 34:04.640
It seems like those
from Great Zhao are useless.

34:04.720 --> 34:05.560
Who said so?

34:11.960 --> 34:13.199
Who says we are useless?

34:17.080 --> 34:19.320
Weren't you supposed
to intercept them outside the capital?

34:19.960 --> 34:21.440
Outside the capital was just for show.

34:22.040 --> 34:23.400
The elite troops are already in ambush.

34:23.480 --> 34:25.880
Last time, we were beaten badly by him.

34:26.960 --> 34:30.280
This time, he must
not be able to return. Attack!

34:30.360 --> 34:37.280
- Attack!
- Attack!

35:28.040 --> 35:31.080
Your Majesty, I am here to pick you up.

35:33.840 --> 35:36.760
Li Zhongnan, you are my subject.

35:36.840 --> 35:39.640
If you stop now, I will spare your life.

35:39.720 --> 35:42.800
As your subject,
if Your Majesty cooperates,

35:42.880 --> 35:45.600
I will plead with Prince Cheng
to spare Your Majesty's life.

35:49.200 --> 35:50.040
Capture him.

36:02.800 --> 36:05.200
Forgive me for being late
in protecting you, Your Majesty.

36:10.600 --> 36:11.680
Jiang Yuanbai.

36:11.760 --> 36:13.880
Traitor, on your knees.

36:15.400 --> 36:16.320
Jiang Yuanbai,

36:17.200 --> 36:18.920
do you think you all can escape

36:19.000 --> 36:20.440
by killing a few of my men?

36:21.000 --> 36:23.520
Listen. Even if you kill me,

36:23.600 --> 36:24.920
you won't be able to get out.

36:25.000 --> 36:27.800
Prince Cheng's men have surrounded
the entire capital.

36:28.720 --> 36:30.400
We are colleagues.

36:30.480 --> 36:32.880
Today, I'll give you a chance.

36:32.960 --> 36:37.400
If you help me take down Zhao Ye,

36:37.480 --> 36:39.680
I will put in a good word for you
with Prince Cheng.

36:39.760 --> 36:42.040
You will earn great merit

36:43.360 --> 36:45.840
and won't lack wealth and honor
in the future.

36:49.400 --> 36:52.760
Li Zhongnan, I've had enough of you.

36:52.840 --> 36:54.320
- You…
- Capture him!

36:55.920 --> 36:59.200
- Don't move.
- You can't escape!

36:59.280 --> 37:01.320
- Move it.
- You can't get out!

37:02.480 --> 37:03.320
Hurry up.

37:06.880 --> 37:09.360
Your Majesty, forgive my rudeness.

37:09.440 --> 37:10.280
You did well.

38:13.760 --> 38:14.600
Leave him alive.

38:14.680 --> 38:15.800
I'll leave this to you then.

38:17.360 --> 38:20.360
Soldiers of Great Zhao, follow me!
Let's reinforce those outside the capital.

38:20.440 --> 38:21.360
- Yes!
- Yes!

38:23.520 --> 38:26.240
Imperial Guards, wipe out the remaining
traitors in the palace with me!

38:26.320 --> 38:27.160
- Yes!
- Yes!

38:34.640 --> 38:35.480
Attack!

38:42.520 --> 38:44.960
Useless people! Where's the Longwu Army?

38:45.440 --> 38:46.440
Why are they not here yet?

38:51.000 --> 38:54.320
Secret Guards, hear my command!
Defend this gate to the death!

38:54.400 --> 38:55.240
- Yes!
- Yes!

39:01.080 --> 39:02.160
Why aren't you attacking?

39:09.200 --> 39:12.120
Your Majesty must leave now. Come on.

39:13.560 --> 39:14.400
Hurry.

39:16.080 --> 39:16.920
Your Majesty.

39:20.960 --> 39:21.800
How did it go?

39:21.880 --> 39:22.800
We can still manage.

39:22.880 --> 39:23.840
Chancellor Jiang,

39:23.920 --> 39:25.840
please bring His Majesty
to the Duke's Mansion first.

39:25.920 --> 39:26.960
- All right.
- My lord.

39:28.680 --> 39:30.600
Your Majesty.
The Longwu Army is heading this way.

39:31.680 --> 39:33.160
If we can't stop them,

39:33.240 --> 39:35.400
they will soon reach the Duke's Mansion.

39:35.960 --> 39:37.000
I can hold them off.

39:41.040 --> 39:43.400
My grandson!

39:50.960 --> 39:53.520
I rescued your wife.

40:40.200 --> 40:41.040
Be careful.

40:41.920 --> 40:43.920
Shen Yurong has the fish talisman.

40:44.000 --> 40:46.160
That man is crazy and wants to kill you.

40:52.760 --> 40:55.040
Old man, take His Majesty
to the Duke's Mansion first.

40:56.360 --> 40:59.080
My lord, I will go with you.

40:59.920 --> 41:02.760
Everyone, heed my order!
Protect His Majesty.

41:02.840 --> 41:03.680
Go.

41:04.720 --> 41:05.560
Xiao Heng!

41:21.240 --> 41:22.240
Where is he going?

41:23.240 --> 41:25.320
He wants to draw the Longwu Army
out of the capital.

41:25.400 --> 41:26.320
What?

41:29.840 --> 41:31.760
Is he trying to get himself killed?

41:32.840 --> 41:34.440
My son has given me

41:34.520 --> 41:36.320
an incredible grandson.

41:38.560 --> 41:39.640
Do you have a bow and arrows?

41:41.000 --> 41:41.920
Bow and arrows?

41:43.920 --> 41:44.760
That man

41:46.840 --> 41:47.960
only taught me archery.

42:05.600 --> 42:06.520
Xiao Heng!

42:08.360 --> 42:10.000
I've been looking for you.

42:10.600 --> 42:12.840
You are actually bold enough to come here.

42:13.480 --> 42:14.400
Release the arrows!

42:20.480 --> 42:21.720
After him!

42:27.040 --> 42:28.000
EAST GATE

42:43.880 --> 42:47.000
Longwu Army, listen to my command!
Kill Xiao Heng!

42:47.560 --> 42:49.320
- Attack!
- Attack!

43:13.640 --> 43:14.480
Back away!

43:19.880 --> 43:23.320
Xiao Heng, I didn't want to kill you.

43:23.920 --> 43:25.880
But Xue Li has fallen for you.

43:26.720 --> 43:30.280
Because of you,
she doesn't even want to look at me.

43:30.840 --> 43:32.960
Even when I gave her my heart,

43:33.520 --> 43:35.200
she doesn't want it at all.

43:35.280 --> 43:37.240
When you buried her on Qingcheng Mountain,

43:37.920 --> 43:39.360
didn't you think this day would come?

43:39.440 --> 43:40.400
Shut up!

43:41.040 --> 43:42.000
Mr. Shen,

43:42.680 --> 43:44.720
how afraid are you to face the past?

43:49.760 --> 43:53.720
Xiao Heng, you're at death's door.

43:54.320 --> 43:56.000
Yet you are still so arrogant!

43:56.080 --> 43:57.720
Li said you're shallow.

43:59.360 --> 44:00.520
I can see that's true.

44:00.600 --> 44:02.360
You have no right to call her that!

44:02.960 --> 44:04.680
You have your back to the wall.

44:05.240 --> 44:08.840
After today, you'll never see her again.

44:12.640 --> 44:16.400
Xiao Heng, no one can save you now.

44:18.920 --> 44:19.760
It does not matter.

44:21.080 --> 44:22.600
Archers!

44:25.920 --> 44:27.160
EAST GATE

44:33.080 --> 44:37.320
This is a fight to the death.
There's no need to think about surviving!
